cronosjs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

internal/cron/cron.go is ported from cronosjs 1.7.1, src/parser.ts,
src/expression.ts and src/date.ts. cronosjs is the scheduler inside Node-RED's
Inject node. The crontabs marked "From cronosjs's own tests" in
internal/cron/testdata/golden.mjs come from its test suite, and
internal/cron/testdata/cronosjs-1.7.1.json is its output.

    cronosjs - https://github.com/jaclarke/cronosjs

